{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3d719d5de01728f40009409b0034ce92.avif?t=1774563864\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras_big/3d719d5de01728f40009409b0034ce92.avif?t=1774563864 width=800 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves, gold, and hidden truths</strong>.<br>Step into the boots of John Nelson - a captain without a ship, a crew, or a past. Sail across an archipelago teeming with colonial rivalries, naval skirmishes, and illicit dealings. Your only compass is instinct - and the journal where you\u2019ll write your own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.poster.avif?t=1774563864\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.webm?t=1774563864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.mp4?t=1774563864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Sea That Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel what it truly means to command a sailing ship. Maneuvering takes wind, space, and foresight. You can\u2019t turn on a dime - every decision matters when the tide is against you, especially when every voyage can bring storms, treasure - or trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/1137d3206fe2215f630ed344040c171c.webp?t=1774563864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/1137d3206fe2215f630ed344040c171c.poster.avif?t=1774563864\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Caribbean to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world shaped by shifting light and shadow in a living <strong>day and night cycle</strong>. Chart unknown waters, unearth buried <strong>treasures</strong>, and follow branching <strong>quests</strong> that lead to power, peril, or revelation. From bustling colonial ports to smugglers\u2019 coves, no journey is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3eeba41cd1e01fdd100837f934e0cd71.webp?t=1774563864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3eeba41cd1e01fdd100837f934e0cd71.poster.avif?t=1774563864\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Past Waiting to Surface</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past isn\u2019t gone - it\u2019s out there, waiting. Clues hide in letters, whispers, and wrecks. Confront those who know more than they admit, and let your <strong>captain\u2019s journal</strong> become the chronicle of betrayal, ambition, and choices you can\u2019t take back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/0c1b06082e1ae703f5417e5d86f06185.webp?t=1774563864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/0c1b06082e1ae703f5417e5d86f06185.poster.avif?t=1774563864\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Command</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own colony and shape its future - or its downfall. Manage resources, assign roles, and keep your <strong>crew</strong> fed, loyal, and willing to fight. <strong>Upgrade your ship</strong>, reinforce your hull, improve your sails, and prepare for whatever the sea throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.webp?t=1774563864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.poster.avif?t=1774563864\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade or Smuggle - It\u2019s Your Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some goods change hands under lantern light. Smuggle rum, tobacco, and rarities along dangerous routes, or trade legitimately - if the price feels worth it. Either way, coin flows, reputations shift, and nothing stays hidden forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812930?t=1774563864","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/9e63dcb91ca0afb696e8e0451fe05b955ea0aecd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774563864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/87d68dd832278b8d0d8bc41ae0c0ac243da47b42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774563864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/87d68dd832278b8d0d8bc41ae0c0ac243da47b42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774563864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":