"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own colony and shape its future - or its downfall. Manage resources, assign roles, and keep your <strong>crew</strong> fed, loyal, and willing to fight. <strong>Upgrade your ship</strong>, reinforce your hull, improve your sails, and prepare for whatever the sea throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.webp?t=1774563864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.poster.avif?t=1774563864\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade or Smuggle - It\u2019s Your Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some goods change hands under lantern light. Smuggle rum, tobacco, and rarities along dangerous routes, or trade legitimately - if the price feels worth it. Either way, coin flows, reputations shift, and nothing stays hidden forever.</p>","developers":["Binary Realm"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/4aa0a98e2c45e7c05f12a8fc6fa9e1de1967d30f/header.jpg?t=1774563864","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812930/1605337942/9e44fc88ab34d0f4449c8924f448c158d744002c/1752608479/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752936650","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/38129