=1774563864","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/05a2d85986f732c934b9b6fa674db6b95ce848ef/ss_05a2d85986f732c934b9b6fa674db6b95ce848ef.600x338.jpg?t=1774563864"}],"short_description":"Sail the 17th-century Caribbean as John Nelson. Smuggle or trade, upgrade your ship, manage your crew and colony, and uncover buried truths across 10+ ports, 50+ branching quests, and a vast open world shaped by shifting alliances and moral choices.","steam_appid":3812930,"support_info":{"email":"support@caribbean-tide.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}